## DelayOS recovery environment: as small as it can be and still repair a system offline.
## No linux-firmware (the screen is the firmware framebuffer, storage/USB/keyboard need none),
## no network. The kernel line is replaced by build.sh (RE_KERNEL, default linux-delayos).
base
linux-delayos
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso

## what the repair tools call
btrfs-progs
e2fsprogs
xfsprogs
dosfstools
cryptsetup
grub
efibootmgr
gptfdisk
parted
squashfs-tools
arch-install-scripts

## the menu: dialog inside kmscon (draws Hangul with its built-in GNU Unifont, no GPU driver needed)
dialog
kmscon

## command prompt comfort
nano
less
